output .latitude{white-space:nowrap}</style><span class=\"plainlinks nourlexpansion\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"//geohack.toolforge.org/geohack.php?language=zh&amp;pagename=%E5%8F%A3%E9%A6%99%E7%B3%96%E7%89%86&amp;params=47_36_29.8794_N_122_20_25.0254_W_\"><span class=\"geo-default\"><span class=\"geo-dms\" title=\"此地的地圖、航拍照片和其他數據\"><span class=\"latitude\">47°36′29.8794″N</span> <span class=\"longitude\">122°20′25.0254″W</span></span></span><span class=\"geo-multi-punct\">&#xfeff; / &#xfeff;</span><span class=\"geo-nondefault\"><span class=\"geo-dec\" title=\"此地的地圖、航拍照片和其他數據\">47.608299833°N 122.340284833°W</span><span style=\"display:none\">&#xfeff; / <span class=\"geo\">47.608299833; -122.340284833</span></span></span></a></span></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"noteTA-be040f7e\" class=\"noteTA\"><div class=\"noteTA-group\"><div data-noteta-group-source=\"module\" data-noteta-group=\"Entertainer\"></div></div></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Seattle_Gum_Wall.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Seattle_Gum_Wall.jpg/250px-Seattle_Gum_Wall.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"167\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Seattle_Gum_Wall.jpg/500px-Seattle_Gum_Wall.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"4272\" data-file-height=\"2848\" /></a><figcaption>口香糖牆，攝於2009年</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gum_wall,_Seattle,_Washington,_Estados_Unidos,_2017-09-02,_DD_19-21_HDR.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Gum_wall%2C_Seattle%2C_Washington%2C_Estados_Unidos%2C_2017-09-02%2C_DD_19-21_HDR.jpg/250px-Gum_wall%2C_Seattle%2C_Washington%2C_Estados_Unidos%2C_2017-09-02%2C_DD_19-21_HDR.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"157\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Gum_wall%2C_Seattle%2C_Washington%2C_Estados_Unidos%2C_2017-09-02%2C_DD_19-21_HDR.jpg/500px-Gum_wall%2C_Seattle%2C_Washington%2C_Estados_Unidos%2C_2017-09-02%2C_DD_19-21_HDR.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"7815\" data-file-height=\"4901\" /></a><figcaption>口香糖牆全貌，攝於2017年</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gumwall.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Gumwall.jpg/250px-Gumwall.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"412\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Gumwall.jpg/500px-Gumwall.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"543\" data-file-height=\"895\" /></a><figcaption>口香糖牆</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>口香糖牆</b>（英語：<span lang=\"en\">Market Theater Gum Wall</span>）是位於<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"美國\">美國</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E9%9B%85%E5%9C%96\" title=\"西雅圖\">西雅圖</a>市中心<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%BE%E5%85%8B%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA\" title=\"派克市場\">派克市場</a>內的一堵黏滿各種<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%A3%E9%A6%99%E7%B3%96\" title=\"口香糖\">口香糖</a>的磚牆，黏滿口香糖的外觀與位於加州的<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"口香糖巷\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Bubblegum Alley\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8F%A3%E9%A6%99%E7%B3%96%E5%B7%B7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"口香糖巷（頁面不存在）\">口香糖巷</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bubblegum_Alley\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Bubblegum Alley\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Bubblegum Alley</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>類似。這堵牆長50英呎，高15英呎。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-cnn&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-cnn-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>這堵牆是市場戲院售票亭的一部分。1990年代，排隊等候<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"Unexpected&#95;Productions\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Unexpected&#95;Productions\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Unexpected_Productions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Unexpected Productions（頁面不存在）\">Unexpected_Productions</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unexpected_Productions\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Unexpected Productions\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Unexpected_Productions</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>表演的大學生會將口香糖黏在牆上<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-st&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-st-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>，劇場工作人員曾幾度刮除口香糖，但此後放棄，口香糖因此逐漸堆積<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-cnn&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-cnn-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。到1999年，當地市場的職員認為這堵牆成了旅遊景點<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-st&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-st-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。一些人持續地往牆上黏口香糖<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-AP&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-AP-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。它在2009年美國的有線電視新聞網（CNN）在「全世界細菌最多的5個觀光景點」報導中，僅次於位於<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%84%9B%E7%88%BE%E8%98%AD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"愛爾蘭\">愛爾蘭</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%91%E5%85%8B%E9%83%A1\" title=\"科克郡\">科克郡</a>的<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"巧言石\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Blarney Stone\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%B7%A7%E8%A8%80%E7%9F%B3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"巧言石（頁面不存在）\">巧言石</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blarney_Stone\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Blarney Stone\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Blarney Stone</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-cnn&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-cnn-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>在2009年上映、由<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A9%B9%E5%A6%AE%E5%BC%97%C2%B7%E5%AE%89%E5%A6%AE%E6%96%AF%E9%A1%BF\" title=\"珍妮佛·安妮斯頓\">珍妮佛·安妮斯頓</a>主演的電影《<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"愛上你，愛上我\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Love&#95;Happens&#95;(2009&#95;film)\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%84%9B%E4%B8%8A%E4%BD%A0%EF%BC%8C%E6%84%9B%E4%B8%8A%E6%88%91&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"愛上你，愛上我（頁面不存在）\">愛上你，愛上我</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love_Happens_(2009_film)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Love Happens (2009 film)\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Love_Happens_(2009_film)</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>》裡，有一些場景是於2008年在這堵牆前拍攝的。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n2015年11月3日，派克市場的保護與發展管理局宣布，這堵牆必須接受20年來首次的全面清洗和維護，以免口香糖上的糖分對牆磚日愈加劇的侵蝕<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。清潔工作自11月10日開始，進行了130小時才完工，清下了超過2,350公斤（5,180磅）的口香糖<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。但在清潔完成後，牆上又開始被黏上新的口香糖。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-14\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-15\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考來源\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E4.BE.86.E6.BA.90\"></span>參考來源</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8F%A3%E9%A6%99%E7%B3%96%E7%89%86&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參考來源\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist reflist-columns\" style=\"column-width: 30em;\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-cnn-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-cnn_1-0\"><sup><b>1.0</b></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-cnn_1-1\"><sup><b>1.1</b></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-cnn_1-2\"><sup><b>1.2</b></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173179\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style: